{"rule_id": "c5a178bf-9cfb-4340-b584-e4df39b6a3e7", "rule_path": "data/sigma/rules-emerging-threats/2018/TA/Slingshot/win_security_apt_slingshot.yml", "title": "Defrag Deactivation - Security", "category": "none", "product": "windows", "urls": ["https://securelist.com/apt-slingshot/84312/"], "text_chars": 22096, "config": {"arm": "baseline", "backend": "OllamaLLMClient", "primary_model": "qwen3-coder:30b", "fast_model": "qwen3-coder:30b", "economy_model": "", "web_enrich": false, "min_chars": 2000}, "run_at": "2026-09-13T22:54:14.209664+00:00", "snapshots_served": 1, "snapshots_missed": 0, "n_rules": 2, "rules_yaml": ["title: Initial Access via Unauthenticated SAML Deserialization\nid: 5f8c0e7a-2b4d-4a8e-9c1f-2d3e4f5a6b7c\nstatus: experimental\ndescription: Detects initial access via unauthenticated HTTP POST to /saml/login with a crafted SAMLRequest body exploiting deserialization vulnerability (CWE-502).\nreferences:\n    - https://securelist.com/apt-slingshot/84312/\n    - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1212/\nauthor: Sigma Assistant\ndate: 2026-09-13\ntags:\n    - attack.initial_access\n    - attack.credential_access\n    - attack.t1212\nlogsource:\n    category: webserver\n    product: apache\n    service: access_log\ndetection:\n    selection:\n        cs-method: POST\n        cs-uri-query: /saml/login\n        cs-uri-stem: /saml/login\n        request_body|contains: SAMLRequest=\n        request_body|contains: rO0AB\n    condition: selection\nfalsepositives:\n    - Legitimate SAML authentication flows\n    - Automated testing tools using SAML\nlevel: high", "title: Execution via Deserialized SAML Payload\nid: 6a7b8c9d-1e2f-3a4b-5c6d-7e8f9a0b1c2d\nstatus: experimental\ndescription: Detects execution stage of attack involving deserialization of attacker-controlled SAMLRequest payload.\nreferences:\n    - https://securelist.com/apt-slingshot/84312/\n    - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1212/\nauthor: Sigma Assistant\ndate: 2026-09-13\ntags:\n    - at