{"rule_id": "76bc1601-9546-4b75-9419-06e0e8d10651", "rule_path": "data/sigma/rules-emerging-threats/2023/TA/3CX-Supply-Chain/proxy_malware_3cx_compromise_susp_ico_requests.yml", "title": "Potential Compromised 3CXDesktopApp ICO C2 File Download", "category": "proxy", "product": "none", "urls": ["https://www.sentinelone.com/blog/smoothoperator-ongoing-campaign-trojanizes-3cx-software-in-software-supply-chain-attack/"], "text_chars": 12600, "config": {"arm": "baseline", "backend": "OllamaLLMClient", "primary_model": "qwen3-coder:30b", "fast_model": "qwen3-coder:30b", "economy_model": "", "web_enrich": false, "min_chars": 2000}, "run_at": "2026-09-13T23:05:24.681809+00:00", "snapshots_served": 1, "snapshots_missed": 0, "n_rules": 4, "rules_yaml": ["title: Initial Access - 3CXDesktopApp Supply Chain Compromise Installer\nid: b0e63e47-8b70-4a21-99d3-8150d8fb9508\nstatus: experimental\ndescription: Detects the initial access phase of the 3CXDesktopApp supply chain attack where a trojanized installer is executed, which serves as a shellcode loader and reflective DLL loader.\nreferences:\n    - https://www.sentinelone.com/blog/smoothoperator-ongoing-campaign-trojanizes-3cx-software-in-software-supply-chain-attack/\n    - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1195/002/\n    - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1203/\n    - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1189/\nauthor: Sigma Assistant\ndate: 2026-09-13\ntags:\n    - attack.initial_access\n    - attack.t1195.002\n    - attack.t1203\n    - attack.t1189\nlogsource:\n    category: process_creation\n    product: windows\ndetection:\n    selection:\n        Image|endswith: '\\3CXDesktopApp.exe'\n        CommandLine|contains: '3CXDesktopApp installer'\n    condition: selection\nfalsepositives:\n    - Legitimate 3CXDesktopApp installations\nlevel: high", "title: Execution - DllGetClassObject Reflective DLL Loading via 3CXDesktopApp\nid: 9f8e7d6c-5b4a-3c2b-1a0f-9e8d7c6b5a4c\nstatus: experimental\ndescription: Detects the execution phase where 3CXDesktopApp uses DllGetClassObject export to reflectively load a malicious DLL, a key technique in the supply chain attack chain.\nreferences:\n    - https://www.sentinelone.com/blog/smoothoperator-ongoing-campaign-trojanizes-3cx-software-in-software-supply-chain-attack/\n    - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1195/002/\n    - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1203/\n    - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1189/\nauthor: Sigma Assistant\ndate: 2026-09-13\ntags:\n    - attack.execution\n    - attack.t1203\n    - attack.t1574.001\nlogsource:\n    category: image_load\n    product: windows\ndetection:\n    selection:\n        Image|endswith: '\\3CXDesktopApp.exe'\n        ImageLoaded|contains: 'DllGetClassObject'\n    condition: selection\nfalsepositives:\n    - Legitimate applications using DllGetClassObject\nlevel: high", "title: Command and Control - 3CXDesktopApp Connecting to GitHub for ICO Files\nid: 936b6b35-2e8b-42b8-8890-29b37162f478\nstatus: experimental\ndescription: Detects command and control activity where 3CXDesktopApp connects to GitHub to download ICO files containing base64 encoded data, which is part of the attack payload delivery mechanism.\nreferences:\n    - https://www.sentinelone.com/blog/smoothoperator-ongoing-campaign-trojanizes-3cx-software-in-software-supply-chain-attack/\n    - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1195/002/\n    - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1203/\n    - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1189/\nauthor: Sigma Assistant\ndate: 2026-09-13\ntags:\n    - attack.command_and_control\n    - attack.t1195.002\nlogsource:\n    category: network_connection\n    product: windows\ndetection:\n    selection:\n        Image|endswith: '\\3CXDesktopApp.exe'\n        DestinationHostname|contains: 'github.com'\n        DestinationPort: 443\n        DestinationUri|contains: 'IconStorages/images'\n    condition: selection\nfalsepositives:\n    - Legitimate GitHub connections by 3CXDesktopApp\nlevel: high", "title: Collection - ICO File Content with Base64 Data in 3CXDesktopApp\nid: 30b82e04-79e5-45fb-9bd5-8826c66856a5\nstatus: experimental\ndescription: Detects the collection phase where ICO files downloaded by 3CXDesktopApp contain base64 encoded data after a '$' character, indicating potential information gathering or exfiltration.\nreferences:\n    - https://www.sentinelone.com/blog/smoothoperator-ongoing-campaign-trojanizes-3cx-software-in-software-supply-chain-attack/\n    - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1195/002/\n    - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1203/\n    - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1189/\nauthor: Sigma Assistant\ndate: 2026-09-13\ntags:\n    - attack.collection\n    - attack.t1195.002\nlogsource:\n    category: file_event\n    product: windows\ndetection:\n    selection:\n        TargetFilename|endswith: '.ico'\n        Image|endswith: '\\3CXDesktopApp.exe'\n        FileContent|contains: '$'\n    condition: selection\nfalsepositives:\n    - Legitimate ICO files with '$' character\nlevel: high"], "scores": {"validity": {"parses": true, "parse_error": null, "issue_count": 1, "issues_by_severity": {"error": 0, "warning": 1, "info": 0}, "issue_types": ["InvalidATTACKTagIssue"]}, "logsource": {"exact_match": false, "fields_matched": 0, "fields_scored": 1, "per_field": {"category": {"predicted": "process_creation", "gold": "proxy", "match": false, "gold_present": true}, "product": {"predicted": "windows", "gold": null, "match": false, "gold_present": false}, "service": {"predicted": null, "gold": null, "match": true, "gold_present": false}}}, "attack": {"exact": {"precision": 0.0, "recall": null, "f1": null, "n_predicted": 3, "n_gold": 0, "n_overlap": 0}, "parent": {"precision": 0.0, "recall": null, "f1": null, "n_predicted": 3, "n_gold": 0, "n_overlap": 0}, "predicted": ["t1189", "t1195.002", "t1203"], "gold": []}, "detection_fields": {"precision": 0.0, "recall": 0.0, "f1": 0.0, "n_predicted": 2, "n_gold": 1, "n_overlap": 0, "predicted_fields": ["commandline", "image"], "gold_fields": ["c-uri"]}}, "response_chars": 6840, "error": null, "elapsed_s": 159.93, "telemetry": {"n_calls": 7, "n_errors": 0, "total_latency_s": 159.51, "prompt_tokens": 33325, "completion_tokens": 8977, "thinking_tokens": 0, "total_tokens": 42302, "calls_with_token_data": 7, "calls_without_token_data": 0, "by_tier": {"economy": {"calls": 7, "prompt_tokens": 33325, "completion_tokens": 8977, "thinking_tokens": 0, "total_tokens": 42302, "latency_s": 159.51001766599995, "errors": 0, "model": "qwen3-coder:30b"}}}, "llm_calls": [{"backend": "ollama", "tier": "economy", "model": "qwen3-coder:30b", "operation": "generate", "latency_s": 5.330610957999966, "prompt_chars": 2795, "response_chars": 1620, "prompt_tokens": 777, "completion_tokens": 362, "thinking_tokens": null, "total_tokens": 1139, "ok": true, "error": null}, {"backend": "ollama", "tier": "economy", "model": "qwen3-coder:30b", "operation": "generate", "latency_s": 10.854369874999975, "prompt_chars": 19900, "response_chars": 2247, "prompt_tokens": 4809, "completion_tokens": 554, "thinking_tokens": null, "total_tokens": 5363, "ok": true, "error": null}, {"backend": "ollama", "tier": "economy", "model": "qwen3-coder:30b", "operation": "generate", "latency_s": 19.636525667, "prompt_chars": 19971, "response_chars": 4483, "prompt_tokens": 4350, "completion_tokens": 1147, "thinking_tokens": null, "total_tokens": 5497, "ok": true, "error": null}, {"backend": "ollama", "tier": "economy", "model": "qwen3-coder:30b", "operation": "generate", "latency_s": 30.331870624999965, "prompt_chars": 37800, "response_chars": 4888, "prompt_tokens": 8927, "completion_tokens": 1435, "thinking_tokens": null, "total_tokens": 10362, "ok": true, "error": null}, {"backend": "ollama", "tier": "economy", "model": "qwen3-coder:30b", "operation": "generate", "latency_s": 27.71199458300009, "prompt_chars": 9294, "response_chars": 6601, "prompt_tokens": 2553, "completion_tokens": 1827, "thinking_tokens": n