{"rule_id": "43259cc4-1b80-4931-bd98-baea01afc196", "rule_path": "data/sigma/rules-emerging-threats/2025/Exploits/CVE-2025-59287/proc_creation_win_exploit_cve_2025_59287.yml", "title": "Exploitation Activity of CVE-2025-59287 - WSUS Suspicious Child Process", "category": "process_creation", "product": "windows", "urls": ["https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/microsoft-cve-2025-59287/", "https://www.huntress.com/blog/exploitation-of-windows-server-update-services-remote-code-execution-vulnerability", "https://hawktrace.com/blog/CVE-2025-59287-UNAUTH"], "text_chars": 35754, "config": {"arm": "baseline", "backend": "OllamaLLMClient", "primary_model": "qwen3-coder:30b", "fast_model": "qwen3-coder:30b", "economy_model": "", "web_enrich": false, "min_chars": 2000}, "run_at": "2026-09-13T23:08:04.616714+00:00", "snapshots_served": 3, "snapshots_missed": 0, "n_rules": 4, "rules_yaml": ["title: Initial Access - WSUS GetCookie() Unsafe Deserialization via BinaryFormatter\nid: 5a1e2b3c-4d5e-6f78-9012-34567890abcd\nstatus: experimental\ndescription: Detects initial access via unauthenticated HTTP POST to WSUS GetCookie endpoint with AuthorizationCookie object triggering unsafe deserialization using BinaryFormatter.\nreferences:\n    - https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/microsoft-cve-2025-59287/\n    - https://www.huntress.com/blog/exploitation-of-windows-server-update-services-remote-code-execution-vulnerability\n    - https://hawktrace.com/blog/CVE-2025-59287-UNAUTH\n    - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1216/002/\nauthor: Sigma Assistant\ndate: 2026-09-13\ntags:\n    - attack.initial_access\n    - attack.execution\n    - attack.t1216.002\nlogsource:\n    category: webserver\n    product: iis\ndetection:\n    selection_method:\n        cs-method: POST\n    selection_uri:\n        cs-uri-query: /GetCookie\n    selection_body:\n        cs-uri-stem: \"/GetCookie\"\n        cs-uri-query: \".*BinaryFormatter.*\"\n    condition: all of selection_*\nfalsepositives:\n    - Legitimate administrative scripts using BinaryFormatter for valid purposes\nlevel: critical", "title: Execution - WSUS Unsafe Deserialization via SoapFormatter\nid: 12345678-1234-1234-1234-123456789012\nstatus: experimental\ndescription: Detects execution of unsafe deserialization via SoapFormatter in WSUS GetCookie endpoint, a known gadget used in CVE-2025-59287 exploitation.\nreferences:\n    - https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/microsoft-cve-2025-59287/\n    - https://www.huntress.com/blog/exploitation-of-windows-server-update-services-remote-code-execution-vulnerability\n    - https://hawktrace.com/blog/CVE-2025-59287-UNAUTH\n    - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1047/\nauthor: Sigma Assistant\ndate: 2026-09-13\ntags:\n    - attack.execution\n    - attack.t1047\nlogsource:\n    category: webserver\n    product: iis\ndetection:\n    selection_method:\n        cs-method: POST\n    selection_uri:\n        cs-uri-query: /GetCookie\n    selection_body:\n        cs-uri-stem: \"/GetCookie\"\n        cs-uri-query: \".*SoapFormatter.*\"\n    condition: all of selection_*\nfalsepositives:\n    - Legitimate SOAP-based web services using SoapFormatter\nlevel: high", "title: Reconnaissance - WSUS SynchronizationUpdateErrorInfoCollection Deserialization\nid: 98765432-4321-4321-4321-210987654321\nstatus: experimental\ndescription: Detects reconnaissance activity involving deserialization of SynchronizationUpdateErrorInfoCollection object in WSUS, indicating potential exploitation of CVE-2025-59287.\nreferences:\n    - https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/microsoft-cve-2025-59287/\n    - https://www.huntress.com/blog/exploitation-of-windows-server-update-services-remote-code-execution-vulnerability\n    - https://hawktrace.com/blog/CVE-2025-59287-UNAUTH\n    - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1218/003/\nauthor: Sigma Assistant\ndate: 2026-09-13\ntags:\n    - attack.reconnaissance\n    - attack.t1218.003\nlogsource:\n    category: webserver\n    product: iis\ndetection:\n    selection_method:\n        cs-method: POST\n    selection_uri:\n        cs-uri-query: /GetCookie\n    selection_body:\n        cs-uri-stem: \"/GetCookie\"\n        cs-uri-query: \".*SynchronizationUpdateErrorInfoCollection.*\"\n    condition: all of selection_*\nfalsepositives:\n    - Legitimate administrative tools using SynchronizationUpdateErrorInfoCollection\nlevel: medium", "title: Exfiltration - WSUS GetCookie() with AuthorizationCookie Object\nid: abcdef12-3456-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\nstatus: experimental\ndescription: Detects exfiltration attempts via unauthenticated HTTP POST to WSUS GetCookie endpoint with AuthorizationCookie object, indicating potential data exfiltration through CVE-2025-59287 exploit.\nreferences:\n    - https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/microsoft-cve-2025-59287/\n    - https://www.huntress.com/blog/exploitation-of-windows-server-update-services-remote-code-execution-vulnerability\n    - https://hawktrace.com/blog/CVE-2025-59287-UNAUTH\n    - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1112/\nauthor: Sigma Assistant\ndate: 2026-09-13\ntags:\n    - attack.exfiltration\n    - attack.t1112\nlogsource:\n    category: webserver\n    product: iis\ndetection:\n    selection_method:\n        cs-method: POST\n    selection_uri:\n        cs-uri-query: /GetCookie\n    selection_body:\n        cs-uri-stem: \"/GetCookie\"\n        cs-uri-query: \".*AuthorizationCookie.*\"\n    condition: all of selection_*\nfalsepositives:\n    - Legitimate administrative scripts using AuthorizationCookie\nlevel: high"], "scores": {"validity": {"parses": true, "parse_error": null, "issue_count": 1, "issues_by_severity": {"error": 0, "warning": 1, "info": 0}, "issue_types": ["InvalidATTACKTagIssue"]}, "logsource": {"exact_match": false, "fields_matched": 0, "fields_scored": 2, "per_field": {"category": {"predicted": "webserver", "gold": "process_creation", "match": false, "gold_present": true}, "product": {"predicted": "iis", "gold": "windows", "match": false, "gold_presen